00:17:26,048 --> 00:17:26,068
Sure.

304
00:17:26,108 --> 00:17:29,228
Is there any chance that Darwin Core will take

305
00:17:29,928 --> 00:17:30,448
on the

306
00:17:31,548 --> 00:17:34,908
vocabularies from Latimer Core, or is it better to

307
00:17:35,548 --> 00:17:36,888
use them both separately?

308
00:17:36,928 --> 00:17:37,848
It's a good question.

