01:07:23,400 --> 01:07:25,920
when you click on the link version of a DOI.

1131
01:07:26,000 --> 01:07:29,580
So this is our old landing page. Our new sample landing page,

1132
01:07:30,060 --> 01:07:33,460
again, more aesthetically pleasing, better layout of windows

1133
01:07:34,180 --> 01:07:38,120
