3869
05:56:24,186 --> 05:56:26,646
or something larger, like focus stacking issues.

3870
05:56:31,886 --> 05:56:35,846
After images are approved and sent to the DAMS, then skeletal

3871
05:56:35,886 --> 05:56:37,706
