3875
05:56:49,406 --> 05:56:51,886
Finally, data is sent to the IPT to GBIF.

3876
05:56:55,506 --> 05:56:59,146
Due to unexpected challenges with the label images, we had to split the

3877
05:56:59,226 --> 05:57:02,606
