4404
06:30:22,584 --> 06:30:26,364
And if you mobilize these data online and attach

4405
06:30:26,424 --> 06:30:27,504
them to the

4406
06:30:28,384 --> 06:30:32,244
digital representations of specimens, the image, and the transcribed

4407
06:30:32,304 --> 06:30:32,864
