4408
06:30:33,764 --> 06:30:35,964
they help build out the extended specimen.

4409
06:30:36,604 --> 06:30:40,464
And by standardizing this technique across institutions who

4410
06:30:40,504 --> 06:30:44,484
are interested in it, we can allow these measurements to

4411
06:30:44,564 --> 06:30:47,804
be interoperable and reusable into the future.

