5352
07:55:31,002 --> 07:55:31,242
So,

5353
07:55:32,762 --> 07:55:34,562
yes, the Latimer Core standard

5354
07:55:34,982 --> 07:55:38,922
allows for much more flexibility than

5355
07:55:39,002 --> 07:55:41,502
what the current GR Cycle model allows.

5356
