We have several possible

5357
07:55:46,042 --> 07:55:49,682
workarounds for modeling some

5358
07:55:49,702 --> 07:55:52,802
hierarchy, but it's not meant for that at all.

5359
07:55:52,882 --> 07:55:53,082
So,

5360
07:55:54,102 --> 07:55:57,622
one possible solution, if you want, is there's the

5361
07:55:57,702 --> 07:56:00,062
field called the incorporated collections.

5362
07:56:00,602 --> 07:56:01,262
So you can

5363
