but I don't have a solution at the moment.

5372
07:56:36,102 --> 07:56:36,362
So,

5373
07:56:40,482 --> 07:56:42,202
with the current model, the

5374
07:56:43,642 --> 07:56:47,302
most you can do is really make a decision

5375
07:56:47,542 --> 07:56:47,862
on

5376
07:56:49,162 --> 07:56:51,902
the level of representation of your collections.

5377
07:56:52,582 --> 07:56:56,242
And then if you do want it to show the relationship between

5378
07:56:56,322 --> 07:57:00,082
the different collection levels, then to use the

5379
