available fields to mention it, but it won't infer

5380
07:57:03,742 --> 07:57:07,702
anything. It will just be information for users who find the collection entry

5381
07:57:08,502 --> 07:57:12,342
saying, "Okay, those other collections are there as well." So, does it

5382
07:57:12,382 --> 07:57:13,202
answer your question?

5383
07:57:16,282 --> 07:57:16,982
Yes. He nodded his head.

5384
07:57:17,282 --> 07:57:17,842
More or less.

5385
07:57:18,182 --> 07:57:22,102
Yeah. And you also can probably add an issue on GitHub if you

5386
07:57:22,382 --> 07:57:23,722
have this issue. I have this issue, too.

5387
