Me next. Yep. So,

5400
07:58:03,086 --> 07:58:06,606
hi. Ooh. Talking too loud, apparently.

5401
07:58:07,866 --> 07:58:10,146
So I'm Sharon Grant. I'm at the Field Museum in Chicago.

5402
07:58:10,186 --> 07:58:10,486
And so

5403
07:58:12,606 --> 07:58:14,386
Marie teed this up really nicely for us.

5404
07:58:14,446 --> 07:58:18,306
So I'm here to talk you through where Latimer Core is right now,

5405
07:58:19,826 --> 07:58:22,946
and what's coming up in the next year with us as

5406
07:58:26,046 --> 07:58:26,686
a maintenance group.

5407
07:58:28,246 --> 07:58:30,446
So hopefully we'll get through some of these questions with you.

5408
07:58:30,926 --> 07:58:34,626
So first up, for those in the room who haven't-- Actually, show of hands, has

5409
07:58:34,666 --> 07:58:36,786
anyone not heard of Latimer Core before?

5410
07:58:39,086 --> 07:58:42,926
I'm impressed you all heard of it. But I'll tell you who we are.

5411
07:58:44,166 --> 07:58:48,066
So we are a maintenance group. We finally got ourselves out from under the

5412
07:58:48,126 --> 07:58:51,166
task group label. We meet every month.

5413
