need help with us talking it through.

5417
07:59:02,846 --> 07:59:03,366
So please

5418
07:59:04,346 --> 07:59:06,526
get in touch, and we will add you. We meet once a month.

5419
07:59:07,886 --> 07:59:10,586
You don't have to come every month, but it'd be great to see you.

5420
07:59:10,626 --> 07:59:11,106
So Jutta,

5421
07:59:11,966 --> 07:59:15,786
Marie, Janine Jones, Ben, Ellie, Martin, and Kate, we are

5422
07:59:17,426 --> 07:59:19,446
the people trying to hold onto this.

5423
07:59:20,566 --> 07:59:23,986
So at its core, as Marie said, it's a standard that--

5424
07:59:25,066 --> 07:59:28,486
Oh, hello. It basically describes intentionally grouped

5425
