08:26:54,158 --> 08:26:58,118
just- Go for it. Thank you ... if I can find it, because I need

5906
08:26:58,158 --> 08:27:01,438
to find it. I just wanted to- Oh ... A, thank everyone for- I got you ...

5907
08:27:01,478 --> 08:27:04,738
coming along and just give you an overview of the actual

5908
08:27:04,798 --> 08:27:07,978
collections descriptions interest group,

5909
08:27:08,718 --> 08:27:12,618
because it is in need of some people to check out that slide right

5910
08:27:12,678 --> 08:27:12,858
there.

5911
08:27:14,038 --> 08:27:15,018
That slide. All right.

5912
08:27:18,638 --> 08:27:22,278
Yeah. So just so that you know, for those of you who are either new to TADWIG or

5913
08:27:22,798 --> 08:27:25,658
have often been confused by this, TADWIG has

5914
08:27:26,058 --> 08:27:30,018
three ways that you can interact with

5915
08:27:30,438 --> 08:27:33,578
the standards work that it does. The interest group is

5916
08:27:34,598 --> 08:27:38,498
for anyone. If you have ideas, you have thoughts, there's something about

5917
08:27:38,578 --> 08:27:41,338
a particular topic, and there's an interest group, you can just

5918
08:27:42,598 --> 08:27:45,978
throw a question up there. What happens after that

5919
08:27:46,578 --> 08:27:50,438
is if that question and that topic turns into a piece of work that

5920
08:27:50,478 --> 08:27:54,418
needs to be done or that the community wants to be done, what happens is a task

5921
08:27:54,458 --> 08:27:57,358
group gets spun up to do a particular thing.

5922
08:27:57,458 --> 08:28:00,398
So for example, MIDS folks, they're a task group.

5923
08:28:00,478 --> 08:28:00,798
They are

5924
08:28:01,718 --> 08:28:02,218
getting the

5925
08:28:03,038 --> 08:28:06,498
MIDS standard to ratification. Once a standard

5926
08:28:07,418 --> 08:28:10,018
is ratified, it then becomes a maintenance group.

5927
08:28:10,078 --> 08:28:13,878
So if you're thinking about Darwin Core, it's been around for a long time.

5928
08:28:13,918 --> 08:28:17,718
It's been ratified. Every now and again, it has a task group that spins up,

5929
08:28:17,918 --> 08:28:18,578
that does a thing

5930
08:28:19,950 --> 08:28:23,910
Once that's done, the task group finishes, and then they move back

5931
08:28:23,950 --> 08:28:27,490
into maintenance group mode. So if you're interested in any of these levels, in any

5932
08:28:27,550 --> 08:28:30,510
of the groups, please get in touch with folks.

5933
08:28:31,730 --> 08:28:33,190
You don't have to do anything in here.

5934
08:28:33,270 --> 08:28:36,090
You just have to have good ideas and talk about things at this point.

5935
08:28:37,450 --> 08:28:40,530
Here, you're vested and you want to see something happen.

5936
08:28:41,190 --> 08:28:43,030
Down there, you want to see something evolve.

5937
08:28:43,270 --> 08:28:44,790
So I just wanted to put that up there as a

5938
08:28:46,510 --> 08:28:46,970
